{"seq":2,"slug":"pre-oxy-combustion","title":"燃烧前与富氧燃烧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture/pre-oxy-combustion","wordCount":1314,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"燃烧前与富氧燃烧\">燃烧前与富氧燃烧</h1><p>如果说<a href=\"post-combustion\">燃烧后捕集</a>是「烧完再收拾」，那么本篇的两条路线就是「换个烧法，让收拾变容易」。燃烧前捕集在燃料进炉之前先把碳剥离出来；富氧燃烧则把助燃的空气换成纯氧，让烟气几乎只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和水。两者的共同思路是从源头改造燃烧过程，制造出一股高浓度、易分离的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，从而绕开燃烧后路线「在稀薄烟气里大海捞针」的能耗困境——代价是更深的工艺改造，因而更适合新建设施而非加装。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这两条路线都在「让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度变高」上做文章，但切入点不同。燃烧前先把固体或气体燃料转化（气化/重整）成合成气，再水汽变换把碳转移到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里、在高压下分离，剩下氢气去燃烧。富氧燃烧则在燃烧的助燃端动手，用空气分离装置（ASU）制出纯氧替代空气，消除了占空气近八成的氮气稀释。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  subgraph 燃烧前&#10;    A1[煤/天然气] --&gt; A2[气化/重整&lt;br/&gt;得合成气 CO+H2]&#10;    A2 --&gt; A3[水汽变换&lt;br/&gt;CO+H2O 转 CO2+H2]&#10;    A3 --&gt; A4[高压物理吸收分离]&#10;    A4 --&gt; A5[纯CO2]&#10;    A4 --&gt; A6[H2 去燃烧/制氢]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 富氧燃烧&#10;    B1[空气] --&gt; B2[空分制氧 ASU]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B3[纯氧 + 燃料燃烧]&#10;    B3 --&gt; B4[烟气 主要是 CO2+H2O]&#10;    B4 --&gt; B5[冷凝脱水得高浓度CO2]&#10;  end\">flowchart TD\n  subgraph 燃烧前\n    A1[煤/天然气] --&gt; A2[气化/重整&lt;br/&gt;得合成气 CO+H2]\n    A2 --&gt; A3[水汽变换&lt;br/&gt;CO+H2O 转 CO2+H2]\n    A3 --&gt; A4[高压物理吸收分离]\n    A4 --&gt; A5[纯CO2]\n    A4 --&gt; A6[H2 去燃烧/制氢]\n  end\n  subgraph 富氧燃烧\n    B1[空气] --&gt; B2[空分制氧 ASU]\n    B2 --&gt; B3[纯氧 + 燃料燃烧]\n    B3 --&gt; B4[烟气 主要是 CO2+H2O]\n    B4 --&gt; B5[冷凝脱水得高浓度CO2]\n  end</pre><p>下表把三条捕集路线放在一起对比，便于看清各自的适配场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>燃烧后</th>\n<th>燃烧前</th>\n<th>富氧燃烧</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动手位置</td>\n<td>烟气尾端</td>\n<td>燃料端</td>\n<td>助燃气端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分压</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（高压）</td>\n<td>高（脱水后）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分离方式</td>\n<td>化学吸收</td>\n<td>物理吸收</td>\n<td>冷凝即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能耗集中在</td>\n<td>溶剂再生</td>\n<td>气化+变换</td>\n<td>空分制氧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加装难度</td>\n<td>低（可改造）</td>\n<td>高（需重建）</td>\n<td>中（需 ASU）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>存量电厂/水泥</td>\n<td>IGCC、制氢、制氨</td>\n<td>新建电厂、水泥</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"燃烧前-把碳从燃料里剥出来\">燃烧前：把碳从燃料里剥出来</h2><p>燃烧前捕集的代表是整体煤气化联合循环（IGCC）。煤先在缺氧高温下气化成以一氧化碳和氢气为主的合成气，再通过水汽变换反应把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CO</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span></span></span></span></span> 转成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，同时多产氢气：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CO</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mo>⇌</mo><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO} + \\text{H}_2\\text{O} \\rightleftharpoons \\text{CO}_2 + \\text{H}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇌</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处于高压、高浓度状态，可以用物理溶剂（如 Selexol、Rectisol）高效吸收——物理吸收靠加压溶解、降压释放，再生不需要大量加热，能耗结构优于燃烧后的化学吸收。剥掉碳后剩下的氢气可以拿去燃烧发电（几乎零碳），也可以直接作为产品。这也是为什么燃烧前路线常与制氢、制氨绑定——它天然产出氢，与<a href=\"../../clean-energy/\">清洁能源</a>里的低碳氢话题相通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"富氧燃烧-让烟气自己变纯\">富氧燃烧：让烟气自己变纯</h2><p>富氧燃烧的巧思在于消除稀释。普通燃烧用空气，其中约 78% 是氮气，纯属「陪跑」，却把烟气里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 稀释到了 4%–14%（见<a href=\"../foundations/sources-pathways\">碳源与减排路径</a>）。如果改用接近纯净的氧气助燃，烟气就只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和水蒸气，把水冷凝掉之后剩下的几乎就是纯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，分离这一步几近免费。代价转移到了前端：制造纯氧的空气分离装置（ASU）非常耗电，能量惩罚从溶剂再生挪到了空分上。为了控制纯氧燃烧的高温，通常还要把部分烟气回流稀释火焰。在水泥行业，富氧燃烧近年成为颇受关注的捕集方案，因为它能同时处理燃料燃烧排放与工艺排放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能量惩罚的-搬家\">能量惩罚的「搬家」</h2><p>三条路线没有免费午餐，区别只在能量惩罚长在哪一段。燃烧后的惩罚在溶剂再生（抽走发电蒸汽），燃烧前在气化与变换，富氧燃烧在空分制氧。选型本质上是在「能耗结构、改造深度、与既有资产的兼容性」之间权衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[能量惩罚来源] --&gt; B[燃烧后: 溶剂再生抽蒸汽]&#10;  A --&gt; C[燃烧前: 气化+水汽变换]&#10;  A --&gt; D[富氧: 空分制氧 ASU 耗电]&#10;  B --&gt; E[加装存量设施成本低但效率降幅明显]&#10;  C --&gt; F[新建可与制氢联产摊薄]&#10;  D --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[能量惩罚来源] --&gt; B[燃烧后: 溶剂再生抽蒸汽]\n  A --&gt; C[燃烧前: 气化+水汽变换]\n  A --&gt; D[富氧: 空分制氧 ASU 耗电]\n  B --&gt; E[加装存量设施成本低但效率降幅明显]\n  C --&gt; F[新建可与制氢联产摊薄]\n  D --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"为什么新建比加装更适合这两条路\">为什么新建比加装更适合这两条路</h2><p>燃烧后能挂在烟囱上，但燃烧前要重建整个气化—变换前端，富氧要新增 ASU 并改造炉膛，二者都更接近「重新设计一座设施」而非「打个补丁」。因此存量电厂改造多走燃烧后，绿地新建尤其是联产氢、氨的化工综合体才更可能选燃烧前或富氧。三者最终都把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压缩、脱水、送入同一条运输封存链，相态控制见<a href=\"../transport-storage/co2-transport\">CO2 运输</a>，最终归宿见<a href=\"../transport-storage/geological-storage\">地质封存</a>。至于从大气这种极低浓度源捕集的特殊路线，属于另一类技术，见<a href=\"direct-air-capture\">直接空气捕集 DAC</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>燃烧前与富氧燃烧都从源头改造燃烧，制造高浓度、易分离的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，绕开燃烧后在稀薄烟气里分离的能耗困境。</li>\n<li>燃烧前（IGCC）先气化、再水汽变换把碳转入高压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用物理吸收分离，并天然联产氢气。</li>\n<li>富氧燃烧用纯氧替代空气消除氮气稀释，烟气脱水后近乎纯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，代价是空分制氧耗电。</li>\n<li>三条路线的能量惩罚分别长在溶剂再生、气化变换、空分制氧——选型是能耗、改造深度、资产兼容性的权衡。</li>\n<li>燃烧前/富氧改造深，更适合新建（尤其联产氢氨）；存量设施加装多走燃烧后。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"燃烧前与富氧燃烧","id":"燃烧前与富氧燃烧"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"燃烧前：把碳从燃料里剥出来","id":"燃烧前-把碳从燃料里剥出来"},{"level":2,"text":"富氧燃烧：让烟气自己变纯","id":"富氧燃烧-让烟气自己变纯"},{"level":2,"text":"能量惩罚的「搬家」","id":"能量惩罚的-搬家"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么新建比加装更适合这两条路","id":"为什么新建比加装更适合这两条路"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"燃烧后捕集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture/post-combustion"},"next":{"title":"直接空气捕集 DAC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture/direct-air-capture"}}